.TH KSTAR-VERSION 1 "" "Kleene Star" "Kleene Star Manual"
.SH NAME
kstar\-version \- show the version, commit, build date and platform
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBkstar version\fR
\fBkstar\fR \-\-version
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Shows this kstar's version, the commit it was built from, the build date
and the platform it was built for. \fBkstar \-\-version\fR and \fBkstar \-V\fR do the
same.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBkstar version\fR
show the version
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBkstar\fR(1),
\fBkstar\-help\fR(1)
.PP
The reference and the tutorial: https://github.com/Pratham71/kleene\-star
